From: Shayne Legault <8741557+shaynelegault@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Input: apple_z2 - add N61 Gen1 touchscreen support

Add the N61 Gen1 firmware framing, startup sequence and input reports. The device match data selects the N61 path; the J71b drain, IRQ and timing policy remain in their existing path.

[Orchard: informed by Corellium projectsandcastle 03db9c6ae04141eb940f3b9f56d446f50d57fadf; integrated with the apple_z2 driver and N61 power and calibration handling.]

---
diff --git a/drivers/input/touchscreen/apple_z2.c b/drivers/input/touchscreen/apple_z2.c
index b1e1a45..9015e86 100644
--- a/drivers/input/touchscreen/apple_z2.c
+++ b/drivers/input/touchscreen/apple_z2.c
@@ -25,6 +25,8 @@
